# Routes standard

`lib/presentations/routes.dart` only parses path/extra into **Screen constructor args**.

```
GoRoute → XxxScreen(args) → Screen owns BlocProvider + getIt + load → View
```

**MAY:** `_buildPage(page: XxxScreen(...))`, typed extra, `onExit` confirm, `detailPopResultFromExtra`.

**MUST NOT:** `BlocProvider` / `BlocProvider.value`, `getIt<UseCase>()`, construct Cubit/Bloc, route to a `*_view.dart`.

Golden: `CustomerDetailScreen`, `AddEditExpenseScreen`, `BanksScreen`, `BankFormScreen`.

Do not piecemeal-fix existing route providers unless adding a **new** route or the user asks for the routes one-pass.

Full workflow: `.agents/workflows/routes.md`
